{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1490100-any-chance-for-chronicles-of-darkness-dice-sets","id":1490100,"title":"Any Chance for Chronicles of Darkness Dice Sets?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-14T00:35:17-07:00","id":1490100,"title":"Any Chance for Chronicles of Darkness Dice Sets?","content":"I used to own some New World of Darkness dice before and while looking around to see if there's somewhere I can buy some more, all I've found is ebay auctions and other hidden corners of the internet where they've run $150 or more. That's way too much money for some d10's. But they were so useful, particularly because the 8, 9, and 10 numbers were differently colored to make marking successes super easy.<br /> <br /> Does anyone know if there is any chance some more of these might get made? While on the search, I thought I found a blog post where Onyx Path mentioned making some dice sets, but I can't seem to find it again. I also have no idea if these dice would have the uniquely colored success numbers.<br /> <br /> If not, I highly recommend it if any of their decision makers see this. I found an old forum post where someone suggested a company called Q-Workshop so maybe they can run another Kickstarter to sell them through a company like that. The high price of those old sets suggest there is a market out there.<br /> <br /> <br /> Tl;dr: Does anyone have any information on special Chronicles of Darkness Dice? Or does anyone know a way I can either buy those old dice for cheaper or get some another way, like maybe there's some custom dice maker service out there I don't know about? <br /> I'd be worried buying a bunch of d10's and painting some of their numbers will throw off some of the randomness and/or not look as good, so that's my last resort. I'd rather just buy some official ones if I could.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27512,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27512-next_raven","user":"Next_Raven","date":". 08-14-2022, 03:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27512-next_raven","name":"Next_Raven","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T00:46:39-07:00","id":1490101,"title":"","content":"Btw, I know there's an app now, but I like having physical dice, too. I realize there's an element of commodity fetishism to it, but I like having physical books and physical dice in addition to the apps and pdf's. They've got that satisfying tactile component, I can lend them to friends during a one-shot, it let's me show off my nerdy hobby in the shelves around my house, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27512-next_raven","name":"Next_Raven","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T12:49:02-07:00","id":1490161,"title":"","content":"I wish there were some official ones, the art in the books is really good, so I am sure they would knock it out of the park if they designed some. But as far as recommendations, <a href=\"https://www.elderwoodacademy.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Elderwood Academy</a> makes high quality dice sets, boxes, mats and so on. They do have an option to customize your order, so if you had some cool ideas for a CofD set, it might be exactly what you are looking for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 08-14-2022, 03:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T18:21:00-07:00","id":1491846,"title":"","content":"I bought a cheap sack of d10s and used colored sharpies to make my own","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9444-joewolz","name":"joewolz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9444_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}